# Same reasoning as travelproductions/.gitignore: we version the record and the
# work, not third-party payload and not regenerable evidence.
#
# What IS versioned here: the six built documents, the client's own imagery
# under site/wp-content/uploads/stock/, the tools that produce the build, the
# architecture document, and the reports.

# Playwright screenshots. ~220 MB of full-page PNGs across the viewport runs,
# and every one is regenerable with viewports.py. The machine-readable
# viewport-results.json for each run IS kept — that is the actual evidence.
reports/viewports*/**/*.png

# The pre-content snapshot is the source's own Spanish documents, held only so
# the copy pass can be re-run from a clean state. Reproducible from
# travelproductions/mirror via tools/restructure.py.
.pre-recontent/

__pycache__/
